  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:252px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Frosty_Ranged_Cannonier.png\" title=\"Frosty Ranged Cannonier\"><img alt=\"Frosty Ranged Cannonier\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"199\" src=\"/images/recovered/Frosty_Ranged_Cannonier.png\" width=\"250\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Frosty_Ranged_Cannonier.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Frosty Ranged Cannonier</div></div></div>\n<p><b>Race:</b>  Mutant\n</p><p><b>Class:</b> Ranger\n</p><p>Similar to <a href=\"/wiki/Mutant_Puker\" title=\"Mutant Puker\">Mutant Pukers</a> these creatures appear to be mostly upper torso, and walk on their hands.  Their arms and shoulders are heavily muscled as they need to be able to support the massive sawblade attachment that is grafted to their chins.\nAs if that wasn't intimidating enough, the Cannonier prefers to launch this spinning sawblade at their opponents.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<a name=\"Basic_Types\"></a><h2> <span class=\"mw-headline\">Basic Types</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n<tr>\n<th>Name\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Habitat\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Frosty Ranged Cannonier\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Balzack's_Burrow\" title=\"Balzack's Burrow\">Balzack's Burrow</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>[GG] Launcher\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/The_Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"The Shadow's Embrace\">Haxhaxor Libratorium</a> off <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Embrace</a>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
